{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban the mandatory use of magnetic phone pouches in schools",
        "additional_details": "We are concerned that schools are investing too much money in magnetic phone pouches. We feel schools should instead invest in basic learning equipment used in classes, as well as lunches, toiletries, and online learning tools.",
        "background": "We want the Government to prohibit schools from forcing students to use magnetic phone pouches.",
